    10	 *  whether they have any (their open (OPEN or PENDING) claims dated within a hold, unless bound by a
    11	 *  statement, then count in no live total), and their own terms in days in force on the sheet's today (null when they have none), and their contact (null when they have none), and the sheet they were
    12	 *  transferred from (null when they were not transferred here), and their past retirements (oldest first), and their tags (as {@link net.officefloor.hq.app.claim.Claim#tags(String)} keeps them; null when none),
    13	 *  and their snapshots (one per SNAPSHOT line written for them, oldest first), and their statements still standing
    14	 *  (by date, oldest first; those a merge or transfer brought over among them), and the reason of their flag while it is
    15	 *  in force (the sheet's today on or before its until-date; null otherwise), and their approver (null when none). */
